OL,3,GNEWSACrews tackle large waste fire in
OL,4,AEssex
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople have been urged to keep doors
OL,7,Fand windows closed as firefighters
OL,8,Ftackle a blaze involving about 200
OL,9,Ftonnes of household waste.
OL,11,FThe fire broke out on Thursday evening
OL,12,Fat a site in Archer's Fields in Pitsea,
OL,13,Fnear Basildon.
OL,15,FEssex County Fire and Rescue Service
OL,16,Fsaid about one third of the waste pile
OL,17,F- which was about 15m high (50ft) - was
OL,18,Falight and crews were working to bring
OL,19,Fthe blaze under control.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
