OL,3,GNEWSACrews tackle large waste fire in
OL,4,AEssex
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe service said: "Smoke is drifting
OL,7,Facross nearby roads. If you live in the
OL,8,Farea, please keep your windows and
OL,9,Fdoors closed."
